0..77 Comment "// Two comparisons that no budget decides, through `std.reals.Eff`. A stop of"
78..114 Comment "// the machine never reads as false."
115..117 Comment "//"
118..197 Comment "// `sqrt 2 < sqrt 2` fails, but no finite enclosure shows it. Each enclosure of"
198..276 Comment "// the left side overlaps each enclosure of the right side, so each pole stays"
277..354 Comment "// live. Each budget ends `exhausted`, and the machine never replies `fails`."
355..432 Comment "// `sqrt 2 · sqrt 2 < 2` fails too, and no finite enclosure shows it either."
433..506 Comment "// The compound chain encloses each cut by its witnesses, so each attempt"
507..571 Comment "// refines the product at twice the precision of the one before."
572..574 Comment "//"
575..653 Comment "// The budgets of 1 and 16 quanta end `exhausted`. At 256 quanta the precision"
654..725 Comment "// reaches the checker\'s quota, so the run ends `suspended`. `gandr run"
726..800 Comment "// boundary.gandr` prints the verdicts of each comparison at 1, 16 and 256"
801..834 Comment "// quanta, one comparison a line."
835..837 Comment "//"
838..913 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/comparison.gandr` — a comparison that holds"
914..987 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-evaluate/src/evaluate/reals/machine.rs` — the"
988..1014 Comment "//   verdicts of a machine"
1016..1048 Comment "// The console\'s host interface."
